<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves dip to $3.418 bln - Jan 29.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves dip to $3.418 bln - Jan 29.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Friday its hard currency reserves dipped to $3.418 billion as of January 29 from $3.457 billion on January 22.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES    Jan 29     Jan 22     Dec 31/96</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	 3.418	3.457	3.473</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	    1.920	2.005	2.321</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector     5.338	5.461	5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
